<title>USA: Industrial Bancorp to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Industrial Bancorp to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Ohio 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Bancorp Inc said Wednesday it will begin a second stock repurchase plan of five percent of its outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>The company said that pending proper notification to the Office of Thrift Supervision, it will purchase 263,840 treasury shares during the next twelve months.</p>
<p>The company completed a similar repurchase program in April.</p>
<p>Industrial Bancorp is the holding company for Industrial Savings and Loan Association, whih had assets of assets of $334 million as of March 31.</p>
